.TH CONV 1 "September 2026" "conv 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
conv, anyconv \- Universal smart CLI file converter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B conv
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE(S)...\fR \fITARGET\fR
.br
.B conv
\fI--list\fR
.br
.B conv
\fIcompletions\fR \fISHELL\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B conv
(also available as \fBanyconv\fR) is an intelligent, high-performance command-line converter. It automatically analyzes input file formats via extension and magic byte header inspection, and selects the optimal underlying engine (FFmpeg, ImageMagick, Pandoc, Calibre ebook-convert, headless LibreOffice, pdftoppm, or a zero-subprocess in-memory Rust data engine) to perform the conversion.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\-dir\fR \fIDIR\fR
Directory where converted files will be saved. Defaults to the same directory as each input file.
.TP
\fB\-j\fR, \fB\-\-jobs\fR \fIN\fR
Maximum number of parallel conversion worker threads (default: min(4, CPU cores)).
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Display planned conversions and commands without executing them.
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite existing output files without prompting.
.TP
\fB\-k\fR, \fB\-\-keep\-going\fR
Continue processing remaining items in a batch if an error occurs on one file.
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-list\fR
Display all supported file formats, backend engines, and system availability.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help information.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version information.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBcompletions\fR \fISHELL\fR
Generate shell auto-completion scripts for \fIbash\fR, \fIzsh\fR, \fIfish\fR, \fIelvish\fR, or \fIpowershell\fR.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Extract MP3 audio from MP4 video:
.B conv video.mp4 audio.mp3
.TP
Convert audio using shorthand target format:
.B conv song.wav mp3
.TP
Batch convert all PNG images to WebP:
.B conv '*.png' webp
.TP
Convert Markdown to HTML:
.B conv doc.md html
.TP
Convert EPUB to Kindle MOBI:
.B conv book.epub mobi
.TP
Convert CSV tabular data to JSON:
.B conv table.csv json
.TP
Preview planned command for video conversion:
.B conv --dry-run video.mp4 gif
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR magick (1),
.BR pandoc (1),
.BR ebook-convert (1)
